sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Mx as Metrics
    participant AS as Autoscaler
    participant SLO as SLO budget
    participant API as Kubernetes API
    participant Sch as Scheduler
    participant Pods as Replicas
    loop each control interval
        AS->>Mx: current utilisation and latency
        AS->>SLO: how much error budget is left?
        AS->>AS: compute the desired replica count
        alt needs more capacity
            AS->>API: scale up
            API->>Sch: place new pods
            Sch->>Pods: bind to nodes
            Note over AS: scale up fast — being slow here burns budget
        else comfortably over-provisioned
            AS->>AS: has it been stable through the cooldown?
            AS->>API: scale down by one step
            Note over AS: scale down slowly — flapping costs more than the nodes
        end
    end
